{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3263","id":3671674196,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887a2U1U","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3263","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3263.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3263.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3263","number":3263,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"policy: support sshTests","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds `sshTests`: the SSH-side parallel of the recently merged ACL `tests:` block. Entries are `{src, dst[], accept[users], deny[users], check[users]}` and evaluate on `SetPolicy`, SIGHUP reload, and `headscale policy check`. `accept` and `check` both count as reachable; `check` additionally requires the matching rule to carry `HoldAndDelegate`. Failures reject the write without mutating live state; boot-time reload warns and continues so a stale reference does not block startup.\n\nBundled with the engine: SSH rule validation tightenings to match Tailscale — whitespace trim on `action`/`users`/`src`/`dst`, rejection of empty/wildcard users and empty `acceptEnv`, rejection of negative `checkPeriod`, rejection of `hosts:` aliases as SSH dst, rejection of non-ASCII tag names, tolerance for tag-owner cycles, and matching wording on group-nesting rejections.\n\nCompat coverage in `testdata/sshtest_results/` and `testdata/ssh_results/` replays recorded policy responses; 8 known-divergent captures are listed with the engine gap each represents (passkey wildcard, configured-tailnet-domain matching, one IPv6 dst evaluator asymmetry).\n","created_at":"2026-05-12T21:00:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T19:10:15Z","closed_at":"2026-05-13T19:10:14Z","merged_at":"2026-05-13T19:10:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"e78a24b8925f3fa51deb8f2d4885560fe75fef70","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"htt